  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: Security constraint bypass in the RewriteValve - the\n     decoded and normalized request URI used for subsequent security\n     constraint matching was produced with java.net.URLDecoder.decode(),\n     which applies form-encoding rules and converts '+' to a space instead\n     of performing proper URI percent-decoding\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-59083.patch: use Tomcat's UDecoder.URLDecode()\n       (already imported and used elsewhere in the class) instead of\n       java.net.URLDecoder.decode() to build the decoded request URI\n     - CVE-2026-59083",
